{"version":1,"content":"<p>人形機械人可以在舞台上跳舞，甚至能完成後空翻動作；但若要讓它們清理餐盤上乾結的食物殘渣，那可就是另一回事了。特斯拉CEO埃隆·馬斯克最近表示，該公司「擎天柱」（Optimus）機械人大約還需要一年到一年半的時間，才能勝任這類家務。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588152.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.855923+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:13:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"9a4622ff0c08b2d2dacd9e94819359ef6ac2b3677349a851761e869a5050b9d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}